# OpenQASM: OpenQASM 3.0 Live Specification (openqasm.com); requirements/languages/openqasm.md
name     openqasm qasm
keyword  OPENQASM include qubit bit qreg creg gate measure reset barrier if else for while in def return
keyword  input output const let ctrl inv pow box delay
type     int uint float angle bool complex duration stretch
builtin  h x y z cx cz rx ry rz s t u pi true false
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.@[]->
calls
